{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Project Zero</strong> is a fast-paced tactical FPS focused on skill, precision, and movement. It features multiple maps, diverse weapons, and classic competitive modes like Bomb and Elimination.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple game modes</strong> \u2013 Team Deathmatch, Free For All, Capture the Flag, Gun Game and Elimination.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety of maps</strong> \u2013 Choose from six unique battlegrounds, from industrial zones to castles and market streets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2257910/extras/75704def8edd3f31a40da60956b57a9c.poster.avif?t=1762547025\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2257910/extras/75704def8edd3f31a40da60956b57a9c.webm?t=1762547025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2257910/extras/75704def8edd3f31a40da60956b57a9c.mp4?t=1762547025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join or create sessions</strong> \u2013 Play with friends or open your session to others in your region. Private matches can be password-protected.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bots available</strong> \u2013 Practice alone or warm up against AI opponents before heading into multiplayer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smooth, classic FPS movement</strong> \u2013 Run, jump, crouch, and take cover with responsive controls.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re looking for a quick match or a longer session with friends, <strong>Project Zero</strong> keeps the action fast, fun, and easy to jump into.</p><h2 class=